      "cardEffectDisplays": [
        {
          "cardElement": "\/card_elements\/01K4JNYB0216YYNKJG71FKYJXV",
          "cardEffect": {
            "cardEffectElements": [
              {
                "idGd": 0,
                "cardEffectElementDisplays": [],
                "type": "OUTPUT",
                "translations": {
                  "es_ES": {
                    "text": "Si fueses a tirar un dado o más, revela también la primera carta de tu mazo.",
                    "locale": "es_ES"
                  },
                  "en_US": {
                    "text": "If you would roll one or more dice, also reveal the top card of your deck.",
                    "locale": "en_US"
                  },
                  "fr_FR": {
                    "text": "Si vous lancez au moins un dé, révélez également la première carte de votre deck.",
                    "locale": "fr_FR"
                  },
                  "de_DE": {
                    "text": "Falls du einen oder mehr Würfel werfen würdest, decke auch die oberste Karte deines Decks auf.",
                    "locale": "de_DE"
                  },
                  "it_IT": {
                    "text": "Se stai per tirare uno o più dadi, rivela anche la prima carta del tuo mazzo.",
                    "locale": "it_IT"
                  }
                },
                "text": "If you would roll one or more dice, also reveal the top card of your deck."
              }
            ],
            "reference": "01624"
          },
          "sequence": 0,
          "id": "01K4JNYBGPJB46WESN41V7CG81"
        },
        {
          "cardElement": "\/card_elements\/01K4JNYB0216YYNKJG71FKYJXV",
          "cardEffect": {
            "cardEffectElements": [
              {
                "idGd": 0,
                "cardEffectElementDisplays": [],
                "type": "OUTPUT",
                "translations": {
                  "fr_FR": {
                    "text": "Lorsque vous révélez une carte de cette façon — Si son Coût de Main est égal au résultat du dé, #vous pouvez m'épuiser ({T}) pour la jouer gratuitement.# (N'activez aucune capacité {h}.)",
                    "locale": "fr_FR"
                  },
                  "es_ES": {
                    "text": "Cuando reveles una carta de esta manera — Si su coste desde la mano es igual al resultado de la tirada, #puedes agotarme ({T}) para jugarla sin coste.# (No actives ninguna habilidad {h}.)",
                    "locale": "es_ES"
                  },
                  "en_US": {
                    "text": "When you reveal a card this way — If its Hand Cost is equal to the die's result, #you may exhaust me ({T}) to play it for free.# (Don't activate any {h} abilities.)",
                    "locale": "en_US"
                  },
                  "it_IT": {
                    "text": "Quando riveli una carta in questo modo — Se il costo dalla mano è pari al risultato dei dadi, #puoi consumarmi ({T}) per giocarla senza pagarne il costo.# (Non attivi alcuna abilità {h}).",
                    "locale": "it_IT"
                  },
                  "de_DE": {
                    "text": "Wenn du auf diese Art eine Karte aufdeckst — Falls ihre Handkosten und das Würfelergebnis gleich sind, #darfst du mich erschöpfen ({T}) und sie kostenlos spielen.# (Aktiviere keine {h} Fähigkeiten.)",
                    "locale": "de_DE"
                  }
                },
                "text": "When you reveal a card this way — If its Hand Cost is equal to the die's result, #you may exhaust me ({T}) to play it for free.# (Don't activate any {h} abilities.)"
              }
            ],
            "reference": "01088"
          },
          "sequence": 1,
          "id": "01K4JNYBY39SVSW8TZM6V86F6G"
        }
      ],
      "value": "If you would roll one or more dice, also reveal the top card of your deck.  When you reveal a card this way — If its Hand Cost is equal to the die's result, you may exhaust me ({T}) to play it for free. (Don't activate any {h} abilities.)",
      "id": "01K4JNYB0216YYNKJG71FKYJXV"
